      "name": "Domain Events & Messaging",
      "summary": "Owns the asynchronous domain event backbone: an event store plus a RabbitMQ (rascal) broker that publishes and subscribes to domain events such as capture-created, tree-created, and raw-capture rejection. Dispatches consumed messages to registered handlers.",
